    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Faaruun isaan isheef faarsan kana. Intallan sabootaas ni faarsu; biyyi Gibxii fi waldaan ishee hundi ni faarsu, jedha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.32.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooftaan.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waggaa kudha lammaffaatti, jiʼa tokkoffaa keessa, guyyaa kudha shanaffaatti dubbiin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.32.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akkana jedhee gara koo dhufe:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Yaa ilma namaa, waldaa namoota Gibxiif wawwaadhu; ishee fi intallan saboota jajjaboo kanneen boolla buʼanitti dabaliitii qileetti darbadhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akkanas isaaniin jedhi; 'Ati eenyu caalaa miidhagda? Gad buʼiitii warra dhagna hin qabanne sana gidduu ciisi.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaan warra goraadeedhaan ajjeefaman gidduutti kufu. Goraadeen luqqifameera; isheen waldaa namoota ishee hunda wajjin lafa irra haa harkifamtu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hooggantoonni jajjaboon awwaala keessaa waaʼee Gibxii fi waaʼee tumsitoota ishee, 'Isaan gad buʼaniiru; warra dhagna hin qabatin kanneen goraadeedhaan qalaman wajjin ciciisaniiru' jedhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Asoor loltoota ishee hunda wajjin achi jirti; isheenis awwaala namoota ishee warra qalaman hundaa kanneen goraadeedhaan dhuman hundaatiin marfamteerti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awwaalli isaanii boolla qilee keessa; loltoonni ishees naannoo awwaala ishee ciciisaniiru. Warri biyya jiraattotaa keessatti sodaa faffacaasan hundi gorraʼamanii goraadeedhaan dhumaniiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Eelaam waldaa namoota ishee kanneen naannoo awwaalaa ishee jiran hunda wajjin achi jirti. Hundi isaanii gorraʼamanii goraadeedhaan dhumaniiru. Warri biyya jiraattotaa keessa sodaa faffacaasan hundi utuu dhagna hin qabatin qilee keessa buʼaniiru. Isaan warra boolla buʼan wajjin qaanii isaanii baadhataniiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waldaa namoota ishee kanneen naannoo awwaala ishee jiran hunda wajjin warra gorraʼaman gidduutti sireen isheedhaaf qopheeffameera. Hundi isaanii warra dhagna hin qabatin kanneen goraadeen dhumanii dha. Sababii sodaan isaanii biyya jiraattotaa keessa faffacaʼeef, isaan warra boolla buʼan wajjin qaanii isaanii baadhataniiru; isaan warra gorraʼaman gidduu ciciisaniiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Meshekii fi Tuubaal waldaa namoota ishee kanneen naannoo awwaala isaanii jiran hunda wajjin achi jiru. Hundi isaanii iyyuu warra dhagna hin qabatin kanneen sababii biyya jiraattotaa keessa sodaa faffacaasaniif goraadeedhaan dhumanii dha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaan gootota dhuman kanneen dhagna hin qabatin kaan, warra miʼa lolaa isaanii wajjin awwaalaman kanneen goraadeewwan boraafatan wajjin hin ciciisanii? Sodaachisuun gootota kanneenii biyya jiraattotaa keessa jiraatu iyyuu adabbiin cubbuu isaaniitiif malu lafee isaanii irra buʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Yaa Faraʼoon, atis cabdee warra dhagna hin qabatin kanneen goraadeedhaan ajjeefaman gidduu ni ciifta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Edoom, mootonni isheetii fi bulchitoonni ishee hundi achi jiru; isaan humna qabaatan iyyuu, warra goraadeedhaan ajjeefaman wajjin ciciisaniiru. Isaan warra dhagna hin qabatin kanneen boolla buʼan wajjin ciciisu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Bulchitoonni kaabaa hundii fi warri Siidoonaa hundi achi jiru; isaan warra jabina isaaniitiin goolii uumaa turan taʼan iyyuu warra gorraʼaman wajjin salphinaan gad buʼan. Utuu dhagna hin qabatin warra goraadeedhaan ajjeefaman wajjin ciciisu; warra boolla buʼan wajjinis salphina isaanii baadhatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Faraʼoonii fi loltoonni isaa hundi jara argu; waldaan namoota isaa hundi goraadeedhaan ajjeefamani iyyuu inni of jajjabeessa, jedha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.32.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooftaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani akka inni biyya jiraattotaa keessa goolii faffacaasu godhu iyyuu, Faraʼoonii fi waldaan namoota isaa hundi warra dhagna hin qabatin kanneen goraadeedhaan ajjeefaman gidduu ni ciciisu, jedha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
